      "source": "https://wellsnyhistoricalsociety.org/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The hamlet of Wells lies on Route 30 beside Algonquin Lake, a widening of the Sacandaga River created by a dam that powered a veneer mill.",
